    "detailed_description": "Magical Girl Survivors: Prologue is a  bullet screen survival game in rougelike mode. <br>FREE DEMO for Magical Girl Survivors.<br>You play as a magical maiden, holding up for 15 minutes against endless orcs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Game Features [/]<br>Three beautiful magic girls and a special costume to choose from (there will be more magic girls and costumes for the standard edition)<br>Active and passive skills are no longer limited by slots, and you can even learn all active and passive skills!<br>Fire, Thunder, Water, Blade, Dark 5 categories of more than 20 skills, different skills can buff each other!<br>A variety of genres to choose from, blood rage build, thorn build and so on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game mode</h2>Kill Orcs with magic to gain experience and upgrade dozens of active and passive skills in the 5 series of Fire, Power, Water, Blade and Darkness.<br>There is interaction between different skill groups, and lower skills can also reinforce higher skills.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141330/extras/a1b00dc3f58944c8e31c0662d2c72304.poster.avif?t=1699529669\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141330/extras/a1b00dc3f58944c8e31c0662d2c72304.webm?t=1699529669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141330/extras/a1b00dc3f58944c8e31c0662d2c72304.mp4?t=1699529669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Forbidden spells</h2>In the case of an orc siege where ordinary magic is not enough to break through,<br>Magical maidens can use powerful forbidden spells, such as Mooncannon, Meteor Shower, and Blade Storm.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141330/extras/fe29cdb24f0eb8ea8153ad027245d908.poster.avif?t=1699529669\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141330/extras/fe29cdb24f0eb8ea8153ad027245d908.webm?t=1699529669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141330/extras/fe29cdb24f0eb8ea8153ad027245d908.mp4?t=1699529669\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2>",
